  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.izsh.L81.1012"] = "[EN] Greetingz zcalelezz being.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.jack.L67.1251"] = "[EN] You!! What have you told my family? They are mad at me and I don't even know why! They think I lied to them about working in Edron in secrecy! Why should I even do that!",
