  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L109.1528"] = "[EN] Oh, well done! Let me take that spider web sample from you - careful, careful... it's sturdy, yet fragile. Thank you! I should be able to make a great paralyse trap with this one. Here, I have something sturdy for you as well - want it?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L114.1529"] = "[EN] Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! How about that studded armor - would you like to have it now?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L121.1530"] = "[EN] |PLAYERNAME|! Thank the gods you are back! While you were gone, something horrible happened. Do you smell the fire?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L128.1531"] = "[EN] Oh my, what happened to your hair? Your face is all black, too - it must have been a hell of flames down there. That's so brave of you. Did you get the book?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L131.1532"] = "[EN] Are you prepared for your next mission, |PLAYERNAME|?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L138.1533"] = "[EN] Now that you know how to store your money, it's time to go after the trolls. I'm even going to give you some more equipment as reward. Do you feel ready for that mission?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L145.1534"] = "[EN] |PLAYERNAME|, welcome back! That was great work you did there. Let me give you something for your efforts - you deserve it. Here, want a helmet?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L150.1535"] = "[EN] Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Do you have enough space for the brass helmet now?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L153.1536"] = "[EN] Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Are you ready for your next mission?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L156.1537"] = "[EN] Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. I see you haven't explored the whole crypt yet - do you need explanations again?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L159.1538"] = "[EN] Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Did you find a nice, fleshy bone in the crypt?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L162.1539"] = "[EN] Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Do you have enough space for that sword now?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L165.1540"] = "[EN] Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|! I'm in a really good mood, I must say. We're almost able to infiltrate Kraknaknork's hideout. I have one last little favour to ask and then my plan is complete. Are you ready?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L168.1541"] = "[EN] Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! But - back so soon? Please find the wasps' lair in the north-western region of Rookgaard and use the flask I gave you on its dead body. Or did you lose the flask?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L171.1542"] = "[EN] Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Were you able to bring back some wasp poison?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L174.1543"] = "[EN] Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Do you have enough space for that brass shield now?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L177.1544"] = "[EN] |PLAYERNAME|, the time of our triumph has come. Are you ready to vanquish Kraknaknork once and for all?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L184.1545"] = "[EN] |PLAYERNAME|! You're back! And you're covered in orc blood... that can only mean... were you able to kill Kraknaknork?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L81.1520"] = "[EN] Welcome, adventurer |PLAYERNAME|. These are dire times for Rookgaard... have you come to help in our {mission}?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L84.1521"] = "[EN] Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Your task is still not done - do you remember everything you need to do?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L87.1522"] = "[EN] Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. I've heard a loud rumbling from the roof - I hope the stones didn't fall on your toes. Have you loaded at least two catapults?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L90.1523"] = "[EN] Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Actually I have some more equipment I could give to you, but first I want to see how you fight. You have fought before, haven't you?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L93.1524"] = "[EN] Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|. Are you done with the 5 rats I asked you to kill?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L938.1546"] = "Прощание.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L939.1547"] = "Прощание.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vescu.L103.84"] = "[EN] Hey t-there, you look like someone who enjoys a good {booze}.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vescu.L196.85"] = "[EN] T-time for another b-beer. <hicks>",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.vescu.L197.86"] = "[EN] Oh, two t-trolls. Hellooo, wittle twolls. <hicks>",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.virgil.L76.212"] = "[EN] Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.virgil.L77.213"] = "[EN] Have a nice day.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.virgil.L78.214"] = "[EN] Have a nice day.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.walter.jaeger.L294.1181"] = "[EN] Please make sure you have free slots in your store inbox.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.walter.jaeger.L485.1182"] = "[EN] Good hunting! I can offer you some lovely {rewards} for finishing prey hunting tasks! Furthermore I can tell you how many hunting task points (HTP) you actually {have} and you have already {spent}.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.walter.jaeger.L486.1183"] = "[EN] Keep on hunting!",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.walter.jaeger.L487.1184"] = "[EN] Keep on hunting!",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.walter.the.guard.L88.164"] = "[EN] LONG LIVE THE KING!",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.wentworth.L387.330"] = "[EN] Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.wentworth.L388.331"] = "[EN] Have a nice day.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.wentworth.L389.332"] = "[EN] Have a nice day.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.willard.L86.1037"] = "[EN] Greetings and Banor be with you, |PLAYERNAME|! May I interest you in a {trade} for weapons, ammunition or armor?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.willard.L87.1038"] = "[EN] Farewell, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.willard.L88.1039"] = "[EN] Farewell, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.willard.L89.1040"] = "[EN] Of course, just browse through my wares. If you're only interested in {distance} equipment, let me know.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.willie.L283.1021"] = "[EN] Yeah go away!",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.willie.L284.1022"] = "[EN] Yeah, bye |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.willie.L285.1023"] = "[EN] Ya take a good look.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.willie.L286.1024"] = "[EN] Hiho |PLAYERNAME|. I hope you're here to {trade}.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.woblin.L115.869"] = "[EN] Hi there human!",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.wyda.L132.1254"] = "[EN] What? A mundane talking to me? Amusing.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.wyrdin.L154.1122"] = "[EN] Hello, what brings you here?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.wyrdin.L155.1123"] = "[EN] Good luck for your travels, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.xelvar.L124.850"] = "[EN] Greetings. Are you interested in adventures?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.xodet.L175.345"] = "[EN] Of course, just browse through my wares. Or do you want to look only at",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.xodet.L176.346"] = "[EN] Good bye and come again.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.xodet.L177.347"] = "[EN] Good bye and come again.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.xorlosh.L91.605"] = "[EN] See you my friend.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.xorlosh.L92.606"] = "[EN] See you my friend.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.xorlosh.L93.607"] = "[EN] Who are you? Are you a genius in mechanics? You don't look like one.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.yaman.L167.634"] = "[EN] Farewell, human.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.yaman.L168.635"] = "[EN] Farewell, human.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.yaman.L169.636"] = "[EN] At your service, just browse through my wares.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.yasir.L830.924"] = "[EN] Si, jema ze harun. <waves>",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.yberius.L169.1364"] = "[EN] Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.yberius.L170.1365"] = "[EN] Remember: If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can heal you for free.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.yberius.L171.1366"] = "[EN] May the gods bless you, |PLAYERNAME|!",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.yoem.L61.188"] = "[EN] Hello |PLAYERNAME|! Do you need some equipment for your house?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.yoem.L62.189"] = "[EN] Have a look. Most furniture comes in handy kits. Just use them in your house to assemble the furniture. Do you want to see only a certain {type} of furniture?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.yonan.L137.684"] = "[EN] How could I help you?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.yonan.L140.685"] = "[EN] How could I help you?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.yonan.L143.686"] = "[EN] How could I help you?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.yonan.L216.687"] = "[EN] Well, bye then.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zalamon.L421.1289"] = "[EN] Not many travellerzz zzezze dayzz. I hope you bring good newzz.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zarifan.L89.1262"] = "[EN] ... ... hello...magic... words?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zebron.L134.469"] = "[EN] Greetings, high roller. So you care for a game, |PLAYERNAME|?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zebron.L135.470"] = "[EN] Hey, you can't leave. Luck is smiling on you. I can feel it!",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zebron.L136.471"] = "[EN] Hey, you can't leave, |PLAYERNAME|. Luck is smiling on you. I can feel it!",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zedrulon.the.fallen.L148.50"] = "[EN] Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zedrulon.the.fallen.L149.51"] = "[EN] Remember: If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can heal you for free.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zedrulon.the.fallen.L150.52"] = "[EN] May the gods bless you, |PLAYERNAME|!",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zerbrus.L210.7"] = "Хм.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L180.497"] = "[EN] Good bye |PLAYERNAME|, may Uman bless you!.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L181.498"] = "[EN] Good bye traveller, take care.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L67.488"] = "[EN] Oh, heaven must have sent you! Could you please help me with a {quest}?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L70.489"] = "[EN] Welcome back, darling... so about that firewood, could you please {help} me?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L73.490"] = "[EN] Welcome back, darling... so about the {dead trees}, let me explain that a little more, {yes}?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L76.491"] = "[EN] Welcome back, darling... so about the {branches}, let me explain that a little more, {yes}?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L79.492"] = "[EN] Welcome back, darling... so about the {pushing}, let me explain that a little more, {yes}?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L82.493"] = "[EN] Welcome back, darling... so about the {cart}, let me explain that a little more, {yes}?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L85.494"] = "[EN] Oh, sweetheart, is there a problem with the quest? Should I {explain} it again?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L88.495"] = "[EN] Right, thank you sweetheart! This will be enough to heat my oven. Oh, and you are probably waiting for your reward, {yes}?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L91.496"] = "[EN] Oh, welcome back, dear Isleth Eagonst! Are you here for a little chat? Just use the highlighted {keywords} again to choose a {topic}.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.ziyad.L100.872"] = "[EN] Ah, the wind brings in another visitor. Welcome, dear guest. Are you looking for a {passage} with my carpet?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.ziyad.L101.873"] = "[EN] Good bye. Recommend us if you were satisfied with our service.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.ziyad.L102.874"] = "[EN] Good bye then.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zizzle.L114.1235"] = "[EN] Ah our human {alliez} have finally arrived! I've already feared zat ze emperor'z forzez had caught you. Your rezilienze and prowezz are imprezzive.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zlak.L103.716"] = "[EN] Juzt leave me alone.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.znozel.L71.200"] = "[EN] Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.znozel.L72.201"] = "[EN] Have a nice day.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.znozel.L73.202"] = "[EN] Have a nice day.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zoltan.L113.593"] = "[EN] Welcome |PLAYERNAME|, student of the arcane arts. I teach the fiercest {spells} available.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zoltan.L114.594"] = "[EN] Use your knowledge wisely, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zora.L82.1328"] = "[EN] Oh, please come in, |PLAYERNAME|. What can I do for you? If you need adventure equipment, ask me for a {trade}.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zora.L83.1329"] = "[EN] Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zora.L84.1330"] = "[EN] Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zora.L85.1331"] = "[EN] Of course, just browse through my wares. {Footballs} have to be purchased separately.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.ztiss.L98.98"] = "[EN] Be greeted my .. {guezt}.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zumtah.L141.1448"] = "[EN] Another visitor to this constricted, cosy, calm realm, perfect except for an {exit}. Muhaha.",
  ["data.otservbr.global.npc.zumtah.L142.1449"] = "Махахаха.",
